 "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le14ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Okay, what about brainstorming ideas to make this party a smashing success!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: In my humble opinion there's nothing people enjoy as much as superb food and good music. What kind of music do you suggest appeals to our audience? I'd say something folky. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: I would disagree. If you ask me, middle-aged women like to celebrate their youth. Personally, I think they'd enjoy a hot 20-something male band."}, {"time": "28090", "image": "engenn7le14ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Good point. Why don't we go with \u201c1WayToHeaven\u201d? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Maybe we should do that. Ok, let's talk about food. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: How about a wine and dine? I also believe finger food would work well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Mixed Salads. I'm convinced all women at least pretend to love salad.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: If you want a successful reception, serve something healthy beside something scrumptious. Like chocolate. And tropical fruit ..."}, {"time": "59000", "image": "engenn7le14ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You hit it Renata! Where's a woman who wouldn't love a chocolate fondue? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I'm sure the accompanying males wouldn't mind either. But don't you think that could nicely follow wine and cheese? Champagne would go well with dessert.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Anything goes with vegetables. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We can have it all. A fantastic reception with the wine flowing! Too bad it's nearly a month away."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Reaching an Agreement"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Food and Music"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le14ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Giving Suggestions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Sometimes you have an idea, a recommendation or plan that you think could work for your company. It is important to use proper language to offer those ideas for someone to consider. Here is some language you can use for giving suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "  <ul><li>What about + noun / -ing? </li> <li>What do you suggest?</li> <li>Why don't we + verb?</li> <li>Maybe we should + verb </li> <li>Let's + verb</li> <li>How about + noun / -ing?</li> <li>Don't you think + clause</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">What about</span> coming up with some ideas for the party?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Let's</span> make a list and decide on the food. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">How about</span> having wine for the party?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Don't you think</span> wine and cheese would work for the party?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">How about</span> serving wine? "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Giving Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own. Here are some ways you can give opinions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>In my humble opinion, + clause </li> <li>I'd say + clause</li> <li>clause + , if you ask me.</li> <li>Personally, + clause </li> <li>I also believe + clause </li> <li>I'm convinced (that) + clause </li> <li>If you + verb, + clause</li> <li>I'm sure (that) + clause </li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">In my humble opinion</span>,  people love good food and music. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'd say</span> some pop music would work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm sure</span> most people wouldn't mind."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> you want a successful party, we need to offer a variety of food and music. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Personally</span>, I prefer salad."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm convinced</span> the band is ideal for the event. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wine and dine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to entertain someone by giving them an expensive meal and wine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How about a wine and dine?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when discussing food and music for an event. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "finger food"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "food to be eaten with the fingers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think finger food would work well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mixed salad"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a salad consisting of mixed salad vegetables such as lettuce, tomato, cucumber, etc."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All women love mixed salad."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fondue"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " A meal that consists of liquid chocolate or hot oil in a container into which you put small pieces of food using a long fork"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Who wouldn't love a chocolate fondue?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tropical fruit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fruit from the hottest parts of the world"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should serve some tropical fruit. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scrumptious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "delicious"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should serve something healthy beside something scrumptious. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You are going to organize an office party for your firm."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down a list of possible food and music you could have."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Have a conversation with a partner and make a few suggestions. (<span class=\"italic\">For example</span>: Why don't we have some sparkling water?)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Support your suggestions with opinions. (<span class=\"italic\">For example</span>: I'm convinced sparkling water is better and cheaper than wine.)"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about foods and music."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give opinions to support my suggestions."}]}]}